---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <section class="container page-intro">
    <div class="eyebrow">About the writer</div>
    <h1>Austin Martin.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      An independent writer working across film, sports, culture and more.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="max-width:800px;padding-bottom:110px">
    <h2>Freelance and editorial.</h2>
    <p>
      Across these varying subjects, I approach writing with an emphasis on research-based accuracy,
      reasoning, and depth of analysis, all while making it digestible for a target audience.
    </p>
    <p>
      An understanding of purpose, audience, and broader context allows me to foster a relationship with
       varying readerships, conveying subject matter through a balance of engagement and clarity.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm interested in freelance and editorial opportunities that allow for rigorous investigation
      and clear presentation, utilizing my experience in technical documentation. But most of all, I
      seek opportunities that offer freedom of exploration through criticism, commentary, analysis, or
      longer-form essays.
    </p>
    <h2>About me and my writing process.</h2>
    <p>
      Film, sports, and culture are subjects of interest, but this space acts as an evolving journal. I use
      this space to refine my own thoughts, while laying out my reasonings on subjects I find worth exploring.
    </p>
    <p>
      My passion for writing reflects my passion for thinking. Each paragraph requires a justification of
      the idea it presents, or it just gets cut should the writing process reveal it necessary. During this,
      striving for truth remains central. My engineering day job reflects an exploration of physical reality in
      pursuit of the truth. Writing represents an abstract form of the same process. And just as any problem
      must first be conceptually subdivided and structured, also do questions of <em>why</em>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each entry is a snapshot of where I stand at a given moment. Change in stance is not only subject but
      encouraged over time. These articles may allow the reader to adapt to how they see the situation of interest,
      or their own situation. I hope that inquiry is rewarded with further inquiry, and knowledge of that subject is expanded.
    </p>
    <p>
      So, I document these thoughts, whether vague and abstract, or tangible and informative. I hope that
      these thoughts may be synthesized by others; being accepted or proven wrong and left be. Thanks for your time.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/">Browse selected work ↗</a>
  </section>
</Base>
